      "properties": { "Node name for S&R": "Note" },
      "widgets_values": [
        "WORKFLOW 11 : TRIO ENSEMBLE DIRECTOR + THEME CONTEXT + SPATIAL LAYOUT DESIGNER + PARTITION-OF-UNITY REGIONAL CONDITIONING + ATTENTION SELECTOR\n1. ZiggartThemeUniverseContext outputs ZIGGART_CONTEXT to Char 1 (Primary), Char 2 (Secondary), Char 3 (Tertiary), Scene Stage, and Trio Ensemble Director.\n2. ZiggartSceneStageAtmosphere outputs ZIGGART_STAGE directly into ZiggartKrea2TrioEnsembleDirector.\n3. ZiggartSpatialLayoutDesigner provides preset snapping + interactive 2D bounding boxes and connects optionally to ZiggartRegionalConditioningComposer.\n4. ZiggartRegionalConditioningComposer uses Partition-of-Unity Gaussian Soft Masks, Complementary Background Masking, Scene Context Harmonization, and Timestep Range Scheduling (0.0 -> 0.70 regional separation + 0.70 -> 1.00 global scene unification)."
